# Review

Determine the requested diff or review scope and inspect surrounding code and tests. Prioritize incorrect behavior, security, compatibility and missing test coverage. Report actionable findings with severity, exact location, evidence and impact; distinguish verified bugs from uncertainty. Mention remaining testing gaps. Do not modify files when only review is requested.

Examples: review a pull request diff; inspect a new authorization check. If the base revision is ambiguous, identify the available diff and state the assumption.
